  "name": "Phantasmal Flames Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Phantasmal Flames prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 1–2 and 8–9 November 2025. Each box held four Phantasmal Flames booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Phantasmal Flames logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Moltres, Zacian, Flygon and Toxtricity, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
